        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-ink" style="font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em;">Ready to Find Out What Learning Violin Actually Feels Like?</h2>
